# PROVENANCE: Synthetic cross-binding regression for authentication random-source retries.
name: D40 and ISO authentication random failures are retryable
case-id: authentication-random-retry-d40-iso
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: generated authentication failure-atomicity regression
issues: https://github.com/cindersocket/dfc-core/issues/131
